 touchscreen tablet while chanting in First Tongue!</div> </div> </div> </div>Feels more mage-y to me. Werewolves have always had a more rugged feel I think, so I suspect he'd be using ripped out computer parts and building something together on the spot for it rather than something nice and clean like just tapping on a tablet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T15:10:21-07:00","id":177376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seidmadr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/175563-no-forsaken-friday-this-week?p=177297#post177297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Feels more mage-y to me. Werewolves have always had a more rugged feel I think, so I suspect he'd be using ripped out computer parts and building something together on the spot for it rather than something nice and clean like just tapping on a tablet.</div> </div> </div> </div>So? You can have a freaking body-builder Rahu flexing muscles all Arnold-like, leering and stuff, rolling Strength + Intimidation. More options to portray stuff isn't a bug, it's a feature.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"li